{"id":"f29382efb1ab3219","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-provability-distributes.md","title":"Provability Distributes","display":"lem-provability-distributes — Provability Distributes","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-provability-distributes","aliases":["92-lem-provability-distributes"],"display":"lem-provability-distributes — Provability Distributes","depends_on":["[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","[[92-lem-derivability-conditions]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-lem-hbl-p4-p6]]"],"source":"第 IX 章 p. 107，P4（PDF 124）","source_status":"原书定理的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-provability-distributes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-provability-distributes</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-provability-distributes — Provability Distributes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16613851c4bce386\" href=\"?note=16613851c4bce386\" title=\"92-ax-modus-ponens\">92-ax-modus-ponens</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c268cc9a199d00a\" href=\"?note=5c268cc9a199d00a\" title=\"92-lem-derivability-conditions\">92-lem-derivability-conditions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"66b904dce6adc7c4\" href=\"?note=66b904dce6adc7c4\" title=\"92-lem-hbl-p4-p6\">92-lem-hbl-p4-p6</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 p. 107，P4（PDF 124）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书定理的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (standard internal provability-formula constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentences)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}provability\\text{-}distributes}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(G\\vdash(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\Bigr)\\Longrightarrow\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}provability\\text{-}distributes}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(G\\vdash(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\Bigr)\\Longrightarrow\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\)</span> : 可证性从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>传递到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span></li>\n<li>这是 P1 与 P2 联合推出的 P4</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\to \\psi\">\\(\\varphi \\to \\psi\\)</span>可证，则可证性传递</li>\n<li>证明使用证明码的Modus Ponens组合函数以及<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D2\">\\(D2\\)</span></li>\n<li>用于证明Löb定理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>这是原书 P4。由外部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\psi\">\\(G\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\psi\\)</span> 用 P1 得内部可证性，再用 P2 和 MP 得结论；仅有 P2 没有前件的 P1 内化不够。参见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"66b904dce6adc7c4\" href=\"?note=66b904dce6adc7c4\" title=\"92-lem-hbl-p4-p6\">92-lem-hbl-p4-p6</a>。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 p. 107，P4（PDF 124）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-modus-ponens","status":"resolved","id":"16613851c4bce386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-derivability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"5c268cc9a199d00a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-lem-derivability-conditions]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-hbl-p4-p6","status":"resolved","id":"66b904dce6adc7c4","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-lem-hbl-p4-p6]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (standard internal provability-formula constructor, see [[92-df-provability-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-hbl-p4-p6","status":"resolved","id":"66b904dce6adc7c4","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"这是原书 P4。由外部 $G\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\psi$ 用 P1 得内部可证性，再用 P2 和 MP 得结论；仅有 P2 没有前件的 P1 内化不够。参见[[92-lem-hbl-p4-p6]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}provability\\text{-}distributes}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(G\\vdash(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\Bigr)\\Longrightarrow\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\to \\psi","display":false},{"tex":"D2","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\psi","display":false}],"bytes":1725,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-241","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-provability-distributes]]"}],"outgoing":["e9cc91aaee998c7b","16613851c4bce386","5c268cc9a199d00a","90f32e29c9d553ed","2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","b78092e29a02d697","66b904dce6adc7c4"]}